[38;5;231m⏺[39m Done — [38;5;153mindex.html:13[39m (style) and [38;5;153mindex.html:22[39m (markup).

  - A native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m wrapped in a [38;5;153m<label>[39m, so clicking the text toggles it. The checkbox itself carries
